title: Preparing for Revolutionary Action
new-page: true
view-if: ugt_revolution_timer <= 0 and psoe_in_government == 0 and casas_viejas_seen == 1 and asturias_revolution_seen == 0
on-arrival: ugt_revolution_timer = 3; month_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
card-image: img/la_union_del_proletariado.jpg
tags: ugt_affairs

= Preparing for Revolutionary Action

With the rise of reactionary parties and the threat of fascism entering government, the revolutionary wing of the UGT and PSOE argues that legal parliamentary roads are closing. If the Republic falls into reactionary hands, an armed uprising—centered in the mining basins of Asturias and industrial centers—may be necessary.

- @secure_arms: Smuggle and cache weapons in mining districts and cities.
- @infiltrate_forces: Contact sympathetic officers in the Guardia Civil.
- @alliance_building_1: Push for the creation of the Workers' Alliance with CNT and PCE.
- @alliance_building_2: Form the Workers' Alliance with CNT and PCE.
- @launch_revolution: Trigger the General Strike and Revolutionary Uprising!
- @root: Postpone preparations.

@secure_arms
subtitle: -1 UGT Resource
choose-if: ugt_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough UGT resources.
on-arrival: rev_weapons += 1; ugt_resources -= 1; js_militancy += 0.07; revolutionary_fervour += 5;
max-visits: 3

Covert smuggling networks transport explosives, rifles and ammunition into union headquarters.

@infiltrate_forces
subtitle: -1 UGT Resource
choose-if: ugt_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough UGT resources.
on-arrival: ugt_resources -= 1; guardia_civil_loyalty += 0.03; ejercito_loyalty += 0.02; revolutionary_fervour += 5;
max-visits: 3

Underground work gains us contacts among army officers and Guardia Civiles.

@alliance_building_1
title: Call for Working-Class Unity
subtitle: Begin public speeches and appeals to other labor organizations.
view-if: alianza_asturias == 0
on-arrival: alianza_asturias = 1; revolutionary_fervour += 10; cnt_relation += 15; pce_relation += 15; caballeristas_strength += 10; prietistas_strength -= 10;

Largo Caballero and UGT leaders issue passionate speeches calling on all working-class organizations to put aside factional rivalries and unite against the fascist threat.

The grassroots membership of both the PCE and CNT responds enthusiastically to the calls for unity, improving relations and spreading revolutionary fervor among rural and urban workers.

@alliance_building_2
title: Negotiate the Workers' Alliance
subtitle: Unite UGT, CNT, PCE and anti-stalinist Communist into a single insurrectionary front. We need good relations with both the PCE and the CNT.
view-if: alianza_asturias == 1
on-arrival: alianza_asturias = 2; revolutionary_fervour += 5; revolutionary_fervour += 5 if pce_relation >= 50; revolutionary_fervour += 5 if cnt_relation >= 50; revolutionary_fervour += 5 if cnt_relation >= 70; pce_relation += 10 if pce_relation >= 50; pce_asturias = 1 if pce_relation >= 50; cnt_relation += 10 if cnt_relation >= 70; cnt_asturias = 1 if cnt_relation >= 50; cnt_asturias = 2 if cnt_relation >= 70; caballeristas_strength += 10; prietistas_strength -= 10;

[? if pce_relation >= 50 : The socialist and communists agree to join a common front to overthrow the fascists. ?] [? if pce_relation < 50 : Negotiations with the PCE have failed, we only got support from smaller trotskyist associations while the PCE talks about "social-fascism". ?] [? if cnt_relation >= 50 and cnt_relation < 70 : The CNT leadership refuses a nationwide alliance, but the regional anarcho-syndicalists in Asturias sign the pact under the slogan "UHP" (Uníos Hermanos Proletarios). ?] [? if cnt_relation >= 70 : Surprisingly, we've been able to convince the National Committee of the CNT to join the general strike nationwide! ?] [? if cnt_relation < 50 : As expected, our differences with the CNT are too big to be accepted just like that ?].

@launch_revolution
title: Preemptively Trigger the Revolutionary Insurrection!
subtitle: Call a nationwide general strike and mobilize armed militias before the reactionary forces can organize.
choose-if: rev_weapons >= 2 and revolutionary_fervour >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: [? if rev_weapons < 2 : We lack sufficient weapon stockpiles to launch an uprising. ?] [? if revolutionary_fervour < 50 : Workers lack the revolutionary fervour needed for a full uprising. ?]
# go-to: asturias_revolution_early

The order is given. Across the country, UGT sirens blow, factories stop, and armed columns take to the streets!
